---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Use | PAVii.AI" customDescription="Terms for Pavii accounts and H-0x pannel.">
  <main class="bg-white px-5 py-20 text-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:px-8">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange-500">PAVii.AI</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Last updated September 6, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-9 text-base leading-7">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Using your Pavii account</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You are responsible for keeping your account secure and for activity performed through it. A shared Pavii identity lets supported Pavii applications recognize the same account, but access to one application does not automatically grant access to another application’s data.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Acceptable use</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Do not use the services to violate law, infringe rights, gain unauthorized access, distribute malicious software, disrupt systems, or evade provider safeguards. You are responsible for reviewing actions performed by agents and automated workflows.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Local data and third-party services</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">H-0x pannel stores its local workspace data on your device. You control backups and device access. Models, integrations, and other services you configure are operated by their respective providers and may have separate terms, limits, and data practices.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Software and updates</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may change, suspend, or discontinue features and may provide updates for security, compatibility, or functionality. Do not rely on previews or local builds as production services.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Availability and responsibility</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">AI output can be incomplete or incorrect and should be reviewed before consequential use. To the extent permitted by applicable law, the services are provided without guarantees of uninterrupted availability or fitness for a particular purpose.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Questions about these terms can be sent to <a class="font-medium text-orange-500 underline" href="mailto:info@pavii.tech">info@pavii.tech</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
